{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/1036397ff76d6341f2e508c8880465a9.poster.avif?t=1765167163\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/1036397ff76d6341f2e508c8880465a9.webm?t=1765167163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/1036397ff76d6341f2e508c8880465a9.mp4?t=1765167163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <u>Story:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The once-great kingdom of Targat has fallen. An army of the undead, led by the ruthless Vezruvil, has burned it to the ground. Your family was executed. You were left to rot in chains. But now, you're free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/755364490c8a181476d2cea4c85ce618.poster.avif?t=1765167163\" width=700 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/755364490c8a181476d2cea4c85ce618.webm?t=1765167163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/755364490c8a181476d2cea4c85ce618.mp4?t=1765167163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Duil</strong>, a man who cannot die. Your quest: fight your way to the heart of darkness and take revenge on the one who destroyed your life. But the deeper you go, the more you realize\u2014this world holds more than just monsters. It holds <strong>secrets</strong>\u2026 and <strong>choices</strong> that will shape your ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/d3540c32310da42468c31b64181747ba.poster.avif?t=1765167163\" width=700 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/d3540c32310da42468c31b64181747ba.webm?t=1765167163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/d3540c32310da42468c31b64181747ba.mp4?t=1765167163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Gameplay Highlights:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immortal, but not invincible</strong> \u2013 When you fall in battle, you're cast into a shadowy labyrinth. Escape it to return to your journey\u2014but you\u2019ll lose one item from your inventory. Every death has a cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your power</strong> \u2013 Find devastating weapons, ancient spells, and dark relics. Upgrade your skills, master brutal combos, and bend magic to your will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon the beyond</strong> \u2013 Call forth otherworldly beings to fight alongside you in relentless battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a living, dying world</strong> \u2013 Talk to strange characters, complete quests, discover hidden rooms, and piece together the history of a shattered land.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your fate</strong> \u2013 Will you show mercy or vengeance? Every decision affects your path and unlocks unique endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/c5480fb0eeb0ee4d727bc53fe29c6f31.poster.avif?t=1765167163\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/c5480fb0eeb0ee4d727bc53fe29c6f31.webm?t=1765167163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/c5480fb0eeb0ee4d727bc53fe29c6f31.mp4?t=1765167163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Key Features:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Branching storylines with <strong>multiple endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep RPG progression   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, upgrade, and manage your <strong>inventory</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fierce combat against monstrous enemies and epic bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich, mysterious lore revealed through exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High <strong>replayability</strong> with meaningful choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting world full of <strong>secrets, relics, and consequences</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/45d97322b82be7dc98af729a6d12fea0.poster.avif?t=1765167163\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/45d97322b82be7dc98af729a6d12fea0.webm?t=1765167163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462030/extras/45d97322b82be7dc98af729a6d12fea0.mp4?t=1765167163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Be Kind.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1462030/6542dd42e4e91bda8ed414d1e5b8b73ed